  "body": "We could shift explicit UTC timestamps by an hour when parsing during a local DST gap.\r\nWe now apply date fields in UTC for explicit timezone tokens and preserve the requested result type.\r\nWe added a regression test and ran the parser and related suites.\r\nFixes #4369\r\n\r\n— [ChipLab](https://chiplab.donmakino.com/findings#clab-2026-1230)\r\n",
